      "index": "a205",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "• Permissionless: anyone may call harvest and earn the bounty, so repayments don't depend on one operator.\n• One harvest per loan per epoch. Swaps use allowlisted routes with an oracle-based minimum out.\n• An Advance with 8 epochs of zero repayment is re-checked on value (see diagram 5).",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 957560352,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "• Permissionless: anyone may call harvest and earn the bounty, so repayments don't depend on one operator.\n• One harvest per loan per epoch. Swaps use allowlisted routes with an oracle-based minimum out.\n• An Advance with 8 epochs of zero repayment is re-checked on value (see diagram 5).",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "updated": 1792934386544,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 59034810,
      "verticalAlign": "middle"
    },
