      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Never liquidated on price. If rewards dip,\nthe loan just takes longer. Only after\n8 Thursdays with zero repayment AND a\nvalue-based health below 1 does an\nAdvance enter this flow.",
